1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:07,070
Standing a coin upright requires seeing a tiny edge before touching it and sensing contact afterward.
把硬币立起来，要先看清细边，再感知接触。

2
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:13,890
FingerEye puts both observations near the fingertip, where wrist cameras can lose the most important local detail.
FingerEye 把观测放到指尖附近，补足腕部视角。

3
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:20,487
Two small RGB cameras observe local object geometry through a transparent contact structure.
两枚 RGB 相机透过透明接触结构观察局部几何。

4
00:00:20,787 --> 00:00:29,367
When the compliant structure deforms, its internal visual features also reveal changes associated with contact, creating a continuous sensing interface.
柔顺结构变形时，内部视觉特征继续反映接触变化。

5
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:35,450
Before contact, the useful signal is alignment with a rim, edge, or narrow opening.
接触前，需要对齐边缘、细边或狭窄开口。

6
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:44,690
After contact, the same local views reveal deformation and changing contact geometry, helping the robot avoid relying only on distant appearance.
接触后，局部视图继续提供形变与几何变化。

7
00:00:45,363 --> 00:00:52,563
The policy first encodes observation groups separately, including each fingertip, wrist vision, and proprioception.
策略先分别编码指尖、腕部视觉和本体信息。

8
00:00:53,183 --> 00:01:00,983
Group-conditioned decoding then gives every group a direct influence on action prediction, reducing competition with easier global visual cues.
解码时各组直接影响动作，减少全局线索的压制。

9
00:01:01,638 --> 00:01:07,258
The real setup uses an xArm7 and a LEAP hand with matched leader-follower demonstrations.
真机是 xArm7 与 LEAP 手，通过同构主从采示教。

10
00:01:07,998 --> 00:01:14,458
The main learned policy reads images and robot state, not estimated contact wrench or plate-pose values directly.
主策略读取图像与状态，不直接输入估计力或板位姿。

11
00:01:15,134 --> 00:01:21,934
Twenty trials per task test coin standing, chip grasping, envelope handling, and syringe operation.
四项真机任务各二十次，覆盖硬币、薯片、信件和注射器。

12
00:01:22,314 --> 00:01:29,094
The four-task average is seventy-one point two five percent, compared with thirty-seven point five using wrist vision alone.
平均成功率七十一点二五，腕部视觉为三十七点五。

13
00:01:29,717 --> 00:01:35,557
That thirty-three point seven five percentage-point improvement comes from a matched sensing ablation.
提高三十三点七五个百分点，来自同设置模态消融。

14
00:01:36,017 --> 00:01:44,117
It supports the value of local continuous observations in this setup, not a universal ranking against every complete dexterous robot system.
支持局部连续观测的价值，不代表所有灵巧系统排名。

15
00:01:44,843 --> 00:01:52,023
The striking fragile-object grasp demonstrations use predefined motion and object-specific stopping thresholds.
脆弱物体演示采用预设轨迹和物体专用停止阈值。

16
00:01:52,623 --> 00:01:59,683
They are separate from the learned-policy benchmark, and three additional simulated tasks must not be counted as physical experiments.
它不同于学习策略测试，另三项仿真也不能算真机。

17
00:02:00,354 --> 00:02:05,474
FingerEye illustrates why sensor placement can change what a policy is able to learn.
FingerEye 展示感知位置如何改变策略能学到什么。

18
00:02:05,794 --> 00:02:16,194
For deployment, evaluate local visibility, calibration, sensor geometry, and training data together instead of assuming more cameras automatically produce better contact control.
落地还要同时验证可见性、标定、几何和训练数据。
